1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
When social media, “boy will be boys,” and vigilante justice
collide, Steubenville, Ohio will never be the same.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Roll Red Roll is a documentary film directed by Nancy Schwartzman.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
At a 2012 pre-season high-school football party in Steubenville, Ohio, a young
woman was raped by members of the beloved high school football team.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
The aftermath exposed an entire culture of complicity—and Roll Red Roll maps out the roles that
peer pressure, denial, sports machismo, and social media each played in the tragedy.

