00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Roll Red Roll is a 2018 American documentary film,
directed and produced by Nancy Schwartzman.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It follows the Steubenville High School rape case.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film had its world premiere at the Tribeca Film Festival on April 22, 2018.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It was released in a limited release on March 22, 2019, by Together
Films, prior to its debut on POV on PBS on June 17, 2019.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film explores themes of rape, woman director, rape culture.
